{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364490/extras/e7abfc52ec0f97d1f643e189cdc030ba.avif?t=1750361483\" width=616 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set a stone's throw into the future, <i>Maid For My Master</i> is a cute romance story between an unlikely pair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Asahi is a young man who was born and raised in the countryside. He moves to Tokyo, hoping to make a new life for himself, but he soon discovers that the big city isn't all it's cracked up to be. Asahi doesn't have much in the way of money, and he has to scrimp and save while working a low-paying job at a convenience store. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Asahi's co-worker, Nazuna, is unfailingly cold and rude, and as chilly winter sets in, Asahi begins to wonder whether he made a mistake in leaving home... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At least, until he meets the mysterious maid, Holly, and feelings between them begin to blossom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Holly is Asahi's dream girl. She's kind, gentle, and affectionate (even if she is slightly taller than he is), but there's a catch. Holly isn't a human at all: she's a robot! Can Asahi's relationship with Holly flourish, or is it doomed to a critical failure? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364490/extras/fca06b2870d97f9e239abb228bc9bfac.avif?t=1750361483\" width=616 height=120 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >90k of text (approx 3-5 hours of reading) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a linear narrative with no choices or branches </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >original character and background artwork in a cute anime style </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >an original soundtrack </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >one robot maid </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a cute romance story!!!</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Meet Holly","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3364490/a40882b008b170810ccdc39f2680e3e419a0440c.jpg"},{"name":"Let's slow down a second...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3364490/16411d9a3d8ef848c00bcc8976c2181192311c9a.jpg"},{"name":"Maid for you","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3364490/f33230a9ea96f7fc34565385bd7233480beab591.jpg"},{"name":"Settling in","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3364490/fc4876814e1cf9462a0b06bf5c7bd97d1da14878.jpg"},{"name":"Wrapping up warm","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3364490/c488a3112b42ea5163549b6e63f7813bcbc82f93.jpg"},{"name":"Monkeying around","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3364490/aa78c6f618a1a5b327c4540ae5bdc55f6bc0e4e1.jpg"},{"name":"Day by day","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3364490/8fc31ccdff927ad3b96bfb0866d5a41d963aa37b.jpg"},{"name":"A moment of rest","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3364490/711b1555fd99fb9478b03081b79592051310c405.jpg"},{"name":"Christmas cake","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3364490/6095e246aaf0d28dedccdb4a29081902355cbc02.jpg"},{"name":"Push and pull","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3364490/d0e12c015a8efa6b047dfdc91176218def885931.jpg"}],"total":13},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3364490?t=1750361483","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364490/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750361483","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamst